WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
We have a question for you. How do you get this job?

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
Spark? How many jobs have you got in total?

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
Too many to count. I don't even know. I really don't know.

00:06.000 --> 00:07.000
Yeah, you don't know.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
I have so many jobs. I really don't know. But enough to keep you busy.

00:10.000 --> 00:11.000
It's been what? Like two years now?

00:11.000 --> 00:12.000
Two years.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.000
For two years taking my money.

00:14.000 --> 00:17.000
And making you more with it. You wouldn't be here if it wasn't like that.

